      "explanation": "Blotchy rash and some respiratory tightness could reflect a widespread urticarial or large local cutaneous reaction with anxiety-mediated perception of breathlessness rather than true anaphylaxis. Presence of only mild respiratory symptoms and absence of documented airway compromise or hypotension makes a non-anaphylactic systemic reaction plausible.",
      "supporting_evidence": [
